etects multiple ordered QP question starts on one page, reconstructs non-overlapping per-question page chains and exact regions, and cross-binds each promoted repair to complete ordered official MS headers. It publishes additive authority and overlay artifacts while leaving frozen v1 history and merged Batch001/Batch002 artifacts byte-identical.\n\nThe deterministic 432-paper census conserves 318 nonempty memberships and 114 zero-row papers separately. It repairs exactly two omissions, moves the nonempty surface from 2,595 to 2,597 rows, and establishes the corrected Batch003 membership at 217. The 3,534 QP-header total is retained strictly as an observation; promoted additive corrected membership is 3,532. Two unrelated QP observations in zero-row papers remain explicitly unpromoted.\n\nNo provider, maker, checker, resolver, external, paid VLM, semantic, KG, canonical, production, public, or downstream calls/writes were made.\n\nVerification:\n- `PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 PYTHONPATH=. /home/samsen/code/ciecopilot-home/.venv/bin/python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1662_same_page_boundary_repair.test.py` — 7/7 passed.\n- `PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 PYTHONPATH=. /home/samsen/code/ciecopilot-home/.venv/bin/python3 scripts/vlm/issue_1662_same_page_boundary_repair.py --check` — PASS; 432 papers, 3,534 QP-header observations, 3,532 corrected membership, zero calls.\n- Second `--write` reconstruction produced byte-identical hashes for all seven published files.\n- Manifest/reconstruction verifier — 6 manifest outputs, 4 reconstruction outputs, and 7 dependencies verified; 10/10 validator gates passed.\n- `git diff --check` — passed.\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` — branch/upstream/workflow/artifact guards healthy; expected warning only for the intended pre-commit changes.","created_at":"2026-07-22T04:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-07-22T05:17:10Z","closed_at":"2026-07-22T05:14:29Z","merged_at":"2026-07-22T05:14:29Z","merge_commit_sha":"cb5306614dbdb4ae1c455c1a2